7egUqH","user":{"login":"shiena","id":1295639,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEyOTU2Mzk=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1295639?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/shiena","html_url":"https://github.com/shiena","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shiena/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shiena/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shiena/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shiena/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shiena/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shiena/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shiena/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shiena/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shiena/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-01-10T15:21:19Z","updated_at":"2026-01-10T15:21:19Z","body":"When Motion JPEG is selected, commit 94971e1b47 on master repeatedly throws the following error under high load (high resolution or frame rate). This PR fixes the error but introduces more block noise, as shown in the attached video. The block noise is likely caused by processing load and remains unresolved.\r\n\r\n```\r\nERROR: Condition \"err\" is true. Returning: Ref<Image>()\r\n   at: _jpeg_turbo_mem_loader_func (modules/jpg/image_loader_libjpeg_turbo.cpp:104)\r\nERROR: Condition \"image.is_null()\" is true. Returning: ERR_PARSE_ERROR\r\n   at: _load_from_buffer (core/io/image.cpp:4542)\r\n```\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/306106e2-3f0a-4267-a8a4-e35c37eee199\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3733015175/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3733124664","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/113359#issuecomment-3733124664","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/113359","id":3733124664,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7egvY4","user":{"login":"shiena","id":1295639,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEyOTU2Mzk=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1295639?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/shiena","html_url":"https://github.com/shiena","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shiena/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shiena/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shiena/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shiena/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shiena/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shiena/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shiena/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shiena/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shiena/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-01-10T16:12:08Z","updated_at":"2026-01-10T16:12:08Z","body":"For reference, playing the camera with the same format using ffmpeg also produces block noise and errors.\r\n\r\n```\r\n$ ffplay -f v4l2 -input_format mjpeg -video_size 640x480 -i /dev/video0\r\n[mjpeg @ 0x726320002440] mjpeg_decode_dc: bad vlc: 0:0 (0x726320004048)\r\n[mjpeg @ 0x726320002440] error dc\r\n[mjpeg @ 0x726320002440] error y=47 x=19\r\n[mjpeg @ 0x726320002440] EOI missing, emulating\r\n```\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/f67144d0-4442-4cae-a532-dbbb0380f019\r\n\r\n","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3733124664/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3734253756","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/113359#issuecomment-3734253756","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/113359","id":3734253756,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7elDC8","user":{"login":"shiena","id":1295639,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEyOTU2Mzk=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1295639?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/shiena","html_url":"https://github.com/shiena","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shiena/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shiena/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shiena/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shiena/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shiena/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shiena/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shiena/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shiena/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shiena/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-01-11T08:45:15Z","updated_at":"2026-01-11T09:15:17Z","body":"I tested with Steam Deck + Logitech C920 and there was no noise. The noise was occurring in a WSL2 + usbipd USB passthrough environment, so it appears the overhead was causing latency.\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/10c0b4bd-f072-48a5-a21b-baf107348b6a\r\n\r\n\r\n","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3734253756/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4523870507","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/113359#issuecomment-4523870507","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/113359","id":4523870507,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABDaTJKw","user":{"login":"j20001970","id":71766835,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcxNzY2ODM1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/71766835?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/j20001970","html_url":"https://github.com/j20001970","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j20001970/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j20001970/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j20001970/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j20001970/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j20001970/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j20001970/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j20001970/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j20001970/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j20001970/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-05-23T02:17:46Z","updated_at":"2026-05-23T02:17:46Z","body":"Tested again with Logitech C270 webcam.\r\n\r\nWhile MJPG decoding works, I'm curious about some decisions in 67af61291a5476a51854b2a6ae3f6c480a80f8e1:\r\n- Why duplicating turbojpeg code in `JpegBufferDecoder`, when `jpeg_turbo_load_image_from_buffer` already do the (almost) same work?\r\n- It seems that `Image::_load_jpg_from_buffer_lenient` ended up not used anywhere.\r\n\r\nAnd after #119570 is merged, decoding partially corrupt MJPG frames with `Image::load_jpg_from_buffer` no longer result in errors, but it will spam warning about \"extraneous bytes before marker\" instead. I think this PR should be updated to better reflect the current situation in `master` branch.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4523870507/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":1},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4525116172","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/113359#issuecomment-4525116172","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/113359","id":4525116172,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABDbfLDA","user":{"login":"shiena","id":1295639,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEyOTU2Mzk=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1295639?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/shiena","html_url":"https://github.com/shiena","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shiena/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shiena/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shiena/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shiena/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shiena/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shiena/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shiena/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shiena/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shiena/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-05-23T11:00:47Z","updated_at":"2026-05-23T11:00:47Z","body":"@j20001970 \r\nYeah, you're right — those ended up as dead code, so I dropped _load_jpg_from_buffer_lenient, _jpg_mem_loader_func_ex, and the ImageMemLoadFuncEx typedef. core/io/image.* and modules/jpg/image_loader_libjpeg_turbo.cpp are back to matching master.\r\n\r\nI did keep the direct turbojpeg calls in JpegBufferDecoder though, since tj3DecompressToYUVPlanes8 (YUV plane output for GPU-side YUV→RGB conversion) isn't exposed by jpeg_turbo_load_image_from_buffer, and reusing a single tjhandle across frames avoids per-frame setup cost on the streaming path. I added a short comment in buffer_decoder.cpp explaining this.\r\n","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4525116172/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":1},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]